  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Ronin7.World::Ronin7.World.Story.DialoguePlayer
  lines:
  - speaker: Khall
    text: You were right. You've always been right, about the order, about all of
      it. It's that you broke because you saw it clearer than any of us, and I'm
      still going to do this anyway.
    seconds: 10
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Khall
    text: I'm sorry it has come to this.
    seconds: 3
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Khall
    text: A hundred times I've read this. Seals check out. Chain of command checks
      out. The hand is right. And it still reads like something built only to look
      real.
    seconds: 10
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: Khall
    text: Who forges a leash. Who fakes an order this clean, and to what end.
    seconds: 5
    clip: {fileID: 0}
  textMesh: {fileID: 1074523871}
  panelRoot: {fileID: 165713976}
  audioSource: {fileID: 804975210}
  billboardToCamera: 1
  playOnStart: 0
  followDistance: 1.5
  followVerticalOffset: -0.55
  followLerp: 12
